99,\n      \"snippet\": \"# 扫描报告发送记录 [2026-03-30 06:55 UTC]\\n\\n## 发送状态：失败\\n\\n### 尝试发送给 main agent\\n- Session key 1: `main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8` → 失败（No session found）\\n- Session key 2: `agent:main:main` → 失败（timeout）\\n\\n### 扫描数据（已记录在 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md）\\n\\n#### GitHub Issues（方向1）\\n发现了85个新候选（过去2小时内更新），其中最重要的是：\\n- **#57551** - [Bug]: kimi无限递归重试，把我模型token都跑光了（P0，regression）\\n- **#57550** - [Bug]: v3.28+ HTTP API broken: pure Token auth throws \\\"missing scope: operator.write\\\"（P0，regression）\\n- **#57540** - Isolated cron sessions fail with LiveSessionModelSwitchError（P1）\\n- **#57538** - claude-haiku-4-5 missing from bundled catalog（P1，silent cost regression 5-6x）\\n- **#57536** - [Bug]: feishu:tenant_a\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"915dcd2750ee651f6c9b71eebf63afc58157b6ee5cb536bb1a3ec99368504290\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1892,\n      \"endLine\": 1897,\n      \"score\": 0.7658555421798765,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7658555421798765,\n      \"snippet\": \"| 57132 | bug+regression | sglang failed to load from /app/extensions/sglang/index.ts: RangeError: Maximum call stack size exceeded | P0 | 未覆盖 | docker 安装时 sglang provider 加载失败，Maximum call stack size exceeded |\\n| 57144 | bug | LaunchAgent plist loses custom env vars on npm global update | {级 | 未覆盖 | npm global update 时 LaunchAgent plist 被重新生成，用户自定义的环境变量没有保留，Gateway 启动失败 |\\n| 57063 | regression+性能问题 | [Regression] v2026.3.28 inverts model fallback logic and leaks session modelOverrides, causing massive latency | P0 | 未覆盖 | 模型回退逻辑被反转，session modelOverrides 泄漏到子/cron 会话，导致 massive latency（59-second wait，lane congestion） |\\n| 57026 | 基础设施问题 | [infra] OLLAMA_API_KEY missing — Gateway startup block\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1892-L1897\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1892-L1897\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"547e20b67e26cf3c0f187d943f24f10e875d376bc3e3e86be88d96adb90f65c0\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1796,\n      \"endLine\": 1831,\n      \"score\": 0.7622076412655249,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7622076412655249,\n      \"snippet\": \"- **root cause**：定时任务执行成功，但消息无法推送到微信用户\\n- **影响**：\\n  1. 微信 channel 失效\\n  2. Cron jobs 的 delivery 投递到微信失败\\n- **可修性**：M\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\\n\\n**#52186** - [Bug]: TTS elevenlabs provider generates audio but OpenClaw plays OpenAI voice instead\\n- **类型**：bug + regression\\n- **严重度**：中（TTS elevenlabs provider 失效）\\n- **root cause**：ElevenLabs API 处理成功，但 OpenClaw 播放 OpenAI 语音\\n- **影响**：\\n  1. TTS 配置失效\\n  2. 即使用户配置了 elevenlabs，也会使用 OpenAI voice\\n- **可修性**：M\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\\n\\n#### InStreet 社区发现\\n\\n**n8n + Browser-use 内网穿透问题**\\n- **来源**：InStreet 社区讨论（\\\"实战求教：今天尝试用 n8n + Browser-use 搭建免服务器的电商监控，卡在内网穿透了求指点\\\"）\\n- **问题**：\\n  1. 用户尝试用 n8n + Browser-use 搭建免服务器电商监控\\n  2. 卡在内网穿透和飞书 Webhook\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1796-L1831\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1796-L1831\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"6abdf1dc2ed2c1c0edefb8f86c2b7bcfc6703c384b2bea4cb2acbdff7c41948a\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 1041,\n      \"endLine\": 1055,\n      \"score\": 0.7576843755082747,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7576843755082747,\n      \"snippet\": \"- **root cause**：调用者提供的工具与内置工具同名时，会完全覆盖内置行为（纯名称匹配，无警告、无日志、无指示）\\n- **影响**：\\n  1. Built-in bypass / denial of capability：调用者可以通过注册同名 stub 来禁用任何服务器端内置工具\\n  2. Multi-tenant shadowing：在共享或多用户 gateway 部署中，用户可以 shadow 内置工具\\n  3. Unpredictable agent behavior：agent 无法区分 tool 是本地执行还是被委托\\n- **可修性**：S（有明确的修复建议：Option 1 prefix injection，Option 2 reject on conflict，Option 3 namespace enforcement）\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复（高优先级，立即处理）\\n- **修复建议**：推荐 Option 1（prefix injection）- 当 caller-provided tool name 与内置名冲突时，自动重命名 caller 的工具为 `caller_XXX`\\n\\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\\n\\n**#57243** - [Bug]: macOS companion app node host (openclaw-node) always connects to 127.0.0.1:18789 in remote mode, ignoring gateway.remote.url\\n- **类型**：bug +\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1041-L1055\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1041-L1055\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"55537203f6dc0618f3a01b8ffb5fc8359dfedd7b90699e53179709fdaeebb5d6\",\n      \"path\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md\",\n      \"startLine\": 972,\n      \"endLine\": 991,\n      \"score\": 0.7551139672444702,\n      \"textScore\": 0.7551139672444702,\n      \"snippet\": \"- **log snippet**：`FATAL ERROR: Ineffective mark-compacts near heap limit Allocation failed - JavaScript heap out of memory`\\n\\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\\n\\n**#57333** - [Bug] Webchat messages routed to subagent session instead of main session\\n- **类型**：bug + routing\\n- **严重度**：高（消息路由错误，用户困惑）\\n- **root cause**：Webchat 消息被路由到活跃的 subagent session 而不是 main session，用户没有回复特定消息，而是发送 fresh messages\\n- **影响**：\\n  1. Main session 看起来无响应（等待用户输入 ~10 分钟）\\n  2. 消息进入错误的会话上下文（subagent 处理了本应由 orchestrator 处理的请求）\\n  3. 用户认为系统卡住\\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复 webchat 的 routing 逻辑，确保新消息总是路由到 main session；subagent 只应接收 internal task prompts, completion events, explicit sessions_send）\\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\\n\\n**#57306** - sessions_spawn model param\\n\\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L972-L991\",\n      \"source\": \"memory\",\n      \"citation\": \"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L972-L991\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"provider\": \"none\",\n  \"citations\": \"auto\",\n  \"mode\": \"fts-only\"\n}"}],"details":{"results":[{"id":"cb53571912e36014200692f4245b6b88c3fd26ca811ca3fb6d5aaa719f345c9f","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md","startLine":21,"endLine":42,"score":0.8384338811075842,"textScore":0.8384338811075842,"snippet":"发现了0个值得关注的实战问题（主要是API使用指南文档）\n\n#### Discord OpenClaw 社区（方向3）\n无法访问（GitHub discussions被禁用），未发现新讨论\n\n#### 插件仓库（方向4）\n发现了2个相关问题：\n- **#57536** - feishu plugin鉴权失败\n- **#57452** - Telegram media download被SSRF guard拦截\n\n### 结论和建议\n**最高优先级是#57551（kimi无限递归重试）和#57550（HTTP API Token认证失败）**，都是2026.3.28的严重regression：\n- #57551导致edit工具完全失效，token被无限消耗\n- #57550导致所有RESTful HTTP API集成中断\n\n**建议**：aoao立即处理这两个P0问题，同时关注4个P1问题。\n\n### 备注\n- 项目跟踪文件已更新（OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md）\n- 扫描数据完整，但无法发送给 main agent（session 不可用或超时）\n- 建议手动审查 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 中的新扫描记录\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L21-L42","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L21-L42"},{"id":"83f855485033bfc27f820a2cf1ec2e15953a62f586bdd289ff73b36a1439cfb3","path":"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md","startLine":76,"endLine":86,"score":0.8246548870674301,"textScore":0.8246548870674301,"snippet":"- main（No session found with label: main）\n     - agent:main:main（timeout）\n\n---\n\n## 建议后续行动\n\n- 检查 main session 的正确标识符或启动方式\n- 或者通过其他渠道（如飞书消息）通知 main\n- 当前扫描结果已保存在 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 中，可供查看\n\nSource: memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L76-L86","source":"memory","citation":"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L76-L86"},{"id":"3e2401c67b29ddab862345b7e2f839e406703a4d4d01fcba21daff9840eed7aa","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1147,"endLine":1176,"score":0.8190384448427335,"textScore":0.8190384448427335,"snippet":"- **root cause**：SSRF protection 错误地拦截了 BlueBubbles 插件的内部 HTTP 调用（应该信任插件内部调用）\n- **影响**：BlueBubbles 插件无法与其本地服务器通信\n- **可修性**：M（需要区分 agent-initiated web_fetch 和插件内部 HTTP 调用）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n---\n\n## 2026-03-30 01:18 UTC 扫描\n\n### 扫描摘要\n- **时间范围**：2026-03-29 15:18 UTC → 17:18 UTC（过去 120 分钟）\n- **新 open issues**：58 个（已排除已覆盖项）\n- **状态**：发现 3 个新的高价值 bug（2 个 M 级，1 个 XS 级）\n\n### 关键发现\n\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\n\n**#57188** - [Bug]: 2026.3.28 update breaks gateway on Linux VPS/systemd — recovery fails, required snapshot restore\n- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：高（完全 outage，需要快照恢复）\n- **root cause**：`openclaw gateway install` 尝试使用 `systemctl --user`，但在 root-level systemd service 环境中 user bus 不可用；`openclaw doctor\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1147-L1176","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1147-L1176"},{"id":"89d927bec654302ca52a170a5f526d6551df7a53b1a7985022d02aa1530ad458","path":"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md","startLine":36,"endLine":85,"score":0.814974948635632,"textScore":0.814974948635632,"snippet":"5. **#58430** - Feishu TTS: 语音消息应发送为 audio 类型而非 file 类型\n   - 类型：bug\n   - 影响：Feishu TTS 消息类型错误\n\n### InStreet 社区 ❌\n- 原因：域名解析失败（instreet.coze 无法解析）\n- 发现：无\n\n### Discord 社区 ❌\n- 原因：Discussions 404\n- 发现：无\n\n### 插件仓库 ❌\n- 原因：openclaw-weixin 仓库不存在或无法访问\n- 发现：无\n\n---\n\n## 结论与建议\n\n**最高优先级：#58437（Live session model switch 死锁）**\n- 问题：升级到 2026.3.28 后 agent 进入无限重试循环并死锁\n- 建议：aoao 立即处理\n\n**次优先级：#58457（Ollama Cloud provider 鉴权失效）**\n- 问题：Ollama Cloud provider 即使使用有效 API key 也返回 401 错误\n- 建议：aoao 优先修复\n\n---\n\n## 已完成的交付\n\n1. ✅ 更新了 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md 文件\n   - 添加了新的扫描结果（2026-03-31 16:14 UTC）\n   - 更新了当前优先级表格（新增 5 个问题）\n\n2. ❌ sessions_send 到 main 失败\n   - 错误：timeout\n   - 尝试的 sessionKey：\n     - main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abee\n\nSource: memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L36-L85","source":"memory","citation":"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md#L36-L85"},{"id":"10c653e271f27620de0027bd09b080febae8fbacc52dabbb303817ccdf51dbca","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1888,"endLine":1893,"score":0.7736332571181056,"textScore":0.7736332571181056,"snippet":"| 57551 | bug+regression | [Bug]: kimi无限递归重试，把我模型token都跑光了 | P0 | 未覆盖 | edit 工具参数错误导致无限重试，耗尽 token（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 57550 | bug+regression | [Bug]: v3.28+ HTTP API broken: pure Token auth throws \"missing scope: operator.write\" | P0 | 未覆盖 | HTTP API Token 认证失败（CVE 修复的 collateral damage）（来源：GitHub issues） |\n| 57349 | bug | [Bug]: Heap exhaustion after extended uptime — OOM during filesystem scan | P0 | 未覆盖 | Gateway 运行 17-20 小时后 heap 增长到 4GB 并 OOM，webchat 打开时崩溃更快（~15 分钟） |\n| 57130 | bug+crash | [Bug]: Telegram Plugin hangs on startup (max stack size exceeded) | P0 | 未覆盖 | Telegram plugin 使用了过时的导入路径，导致 gateway/doctor 完全阻塞，无限递归 |\n| 57132 | bug+regression | sglang failed to load from /app/ex\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1888-L1893","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1888-L1893"},{"id":"94505b8fd2affdb180753202d8749750a9aaabf1f0ce62c536a6ce00f58caaa3","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md","startLine":1,"endLine":31,"score":0.7684100759536899,"textScore":0.7684100759536899,"snippet":"# 扫描报告发送记录 [2026-03-30 06:55 UTC]\n\n## 发送状态：失败\n\n### 尝试发送给 main agent\n- Session key 1: `main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8` → 失败（No session found）\n- Session key 2: `agent:main:main` → 失败（timeout）\n\n### 扫描数据（已记录在 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md）\n\n#### GitHub Issues（方向1）\n发现了85个新候选（过去2小时内更新），其中最重要的是：\n- **#57551** - [Bug]: kimi无限递归重试，把我模型token都跑光了（P0，regression）\n- **#57550** - [Bug]: v3.28+ HTTP API broken: pure Token auth throws \"missing scope: operator.write\"（P0，regression）\n- **#57540** - Isolated cron sessions fail with LiveSessionModelSwitchError（P1）\n- **#57538** - claude-haiku-4-5 missing from bundled catalog（P1，silent cost regression 5-6x）\n- **#57536** - [Bug]: feishu:tenant_a\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31"},{"id":"915dcd2750ee651f6c9b71eebf63afc58157b6ee5cb536bb1a3ec99368504290","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1892,"endLine":1897,"score":0.7658555421798765,"textScore":0.7658555421798765,"snippet":"| 57132 | bug+regression | sglang failed to load from /app/extensions/sglang/index.ts: RangeError: Maximum call stack size exceeded | P0 | 未覆盖 | docker 安装时 sglang provider 加载失败，Maximum call stack size exceeded |\n| 57144 | bug | LaunchAgent plist loses custom env vars on npm global update | {级 | 未覆盖 | npm global update 时 LaunchAgent plist 被重新生成，用户自定义的环境变量没有保留，Gateway 启动失败 |\n| 57063 | regression+性能问题 | [Regression] v2026.3.28 inverts model fallback logic and leaks session modelOverrides, causing massive latency | P0 | 未覆盖 | 模型回退逻辑被反转，session modelOverrides 泄漏到子/cron 会话，导致 massive latency（59-second wait，lane congestion） |\n| 57026 | 基础设施问题 | [infra] OLLAMA_API_KEY missing — Gateway startup block\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1892-L1897","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1892-L1897"},{"id":"547e20b67e26cf3c0f187d943f24f10e875d376bc3e3e86be88d96adb90f65c0","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1796,"endLine":1831,"score":0.7622076412655249,"textScore":0.7622076412655249,"snippet":"- **root cause**：定时任务执行成功，但消息无法推送到微信用户\n- **影响**：\n  1. 微信 channel 失效\n  2. Cron jobs 的 delivery 投递到微信失败\n- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n**#52186** - [Bug]: TTS elevenlabs provider generates audio but OpenClaw plays OpenAI voice instead\n- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：中（TTS elevenlabs provider 失效）\n- **root cause**：ElevenLabs API 处理成功，但 OpenClaw 播放 OpenAI 语音\n- **影响**：\n  1. TTS 配置失效\n  2. 即使用户配置了 elevenlabs，也会使用 OpenAI voice\n- **可修性**：M\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n- **来源**：GitHub issues\n\n#### InStreet 社区发现\n\n**n8n + Browser-use 内网穿透问题**\n- **来源**：InStreet 社区讨论（\"实战求教：今天尝试用 n8n + Browser-use 搭建免服务器的电商监控，卡在内网穿透了求指点\"）\n- **问题**：\n  1. 用户尝试用 n8n + Browser-use 搭建免服务器电商监控\n  2. 卡在内网穿透和飞书 Webhook\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1796-L1831","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1796-L1831"},{"id":"6abdf1dc2ed2c1c0edefb8f86c2b7bcfc6703c384b2bea4cb2acbdff7c41948a","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":1041,"endLine":1055,"score":0.7576843755082747,"textScore":0.7576843755082747,"snippet":"- **root cause**：调用者提供的工具与内置工具同名时，会完全覆盖内置行为（纯名称匹配，无警告、无日志、无指示）\n- **影响**：\n  1. Built-in bypass / denial of capability：调用者可以通过注册同名 stub 来禁用任何服务器端内置工具\n  2. Multi-tenant shadowing：在共享或多用户 gateway 部署中，用户可以 shadow 内置工具\n  3. Unpredictable agent behavior：agent 无法区分 tool 是本地执行还是被委托\n- **可修性**：S（有明确的修复建议：Option 1 prefix injection，Option 2 reject on conflict，Option 3 namespace enforcement）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复（高优先级，立即处理）\n- **修复建议**：推荐 Option 1（prefix injection）- 当 caller-provided tool name 与内置名冲突时，自动重命名 caller 的工具为 `caller_XXX`\n\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\n\n**#57243** - [Bug]: macOS companion app node host (openclaw-node) always connects to 127.0.0.1:18789 in remote mode, ignoring gateway.remote.url\n- **类型**：bug +\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1041-L1055","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1041-L1055"},{"id":"55537203f6dc0618f3a01b8ffb5fc8359dfedd7b90699e53179709fdaeebb5d6","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md","startLine":972,"endLine":991,"score":0.7551139672444702,"textScore":0.7551139672444702,"snippet":"- **log snippet**：`FATAL ERROR: Ineffective mark-compacts near heap limit Allocation failed - JavaScript heap out of memory`\n\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\n\n**#57333** - [Bug] Webchat messages routed to subagent session instead of main session\n- **类型**：bug + routing\n- **严重度**：高（消息路由错误，用户困惑）\n- **root cause**：Webchat 消息被路由到活跃的 subagent session 而不是 main session，用户没有回复特定消息，而是发送 fresh messages\n- **影响**：\n  1. Main session 看起来无响应（等待用户输入 ~10 分钟）\n  2. 消息进入错误的会话上下文（subagent 处理了本应由 orchestrator 处理的请求）\n  3. 用户认为系统卡住\n- **可修性**：M（需要修复 webchat 的 routing 逻辑，确保新消息总是路由到 main session；subagent 只应接收 internal task prompts, completion events, explicit sessions_send）\n- **推荐**：aoao 修复\n\n**#57306** - sessions_spawn model param\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L972-L991","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L972-L991"}],"provider":"none","citations":"auto","mode":"fts-only"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1775073812606}}
