ing credits with no output\\\" openclaw discussion\",\"count\":5}"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_BwB2anGhQBMETM9iXOGrgNVQ|fc_062cdbb2f0b8822d0169cd7a5fc7448191b95aa9b733bfb815","name":"web_search","arguments":{"query":"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/discussions OpenClaw compaction burning credits","count":5},"partialJson":"{\"query\":\"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/discussions OpenClaw compaction burning credits\",\"count\":5}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":7233,"output":144,"cacheRead":49920,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":57297,"cost":{"input":0.0180825,"output":0.00216,"cacheRead":0.01248,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0327225}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1775073881376,"responseId":"resp_062cdbb2f0b8822d0169cd7a59af608191b97ea91925251c70"}}
{"type":"message","id":"1fb21af0","parentId":"3e152ceb","timestamp":"2026-04-01T20:04:50.577Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_SGOHfSOfPgEGmnZTTfE9zv30|fc_062cdbb2f0b8822d0169cd7a5fc73081918d4f8571c0993ecd","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"\\\"Need Help — Telegram agent persist on session/chat\\\" openclaw discussion\",\n  \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n  \"count\": 5,\n  \"tookMs\": 2432,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"00edd6c1b0512390\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSession Management - OpenClaw\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"00edd6c1b0512390\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.openclaw.ai/concepts/session\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2261fa38c16bc927\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n##### Fundamentals. ##### Sessions and memory. ##### Multi-agent. ##### Messages and delivery. # Session Management. # ​ Session Management. ## ​ How messages are routed. | Direct messages | Shared session by default |. | Group chats | Isolated per group |. | Rooms/channels | Isolated per room |. | Cron jobs | Fresh session per run |. ## ​ DM isolation. dmScope: \\\"per-channel-peer\\\", // isolate by channel + sender. ## ​ Session lifecycle. ## ​ Where state lives. `~/.openclaw/agents/<agentId>/sessions/sessions.json`. `~/.openclaw/agents/<agentId>/sessions/<sessionId>.jsonl`. ## ​ Session maintenance. `openclaw sessions cleanup --dry-run`. ## ​ Inspecting sessions. ## ​ Further reading.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2261fa38c16bc927\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.9997749\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6b95f3d1d5e96145\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTelegram main session can wedge after long-running ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6b95f3d1d5e96145\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/51014\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b49e5888cd395f42\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nWhat happened. An OpenClaw instance running on Telegram stopped replying even though the Telegram webhook path itself remained healthy.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"b49e5888cd395f42\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.9995234\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4ce454c3d8c9a518\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw: Setting Up Your First Personal AI Agent - Every\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"4ce454c3d8c9a518\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://every.to/source-code/openclaw-setting-up-your-first-personal-ai-agent\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2ef43d0b756c7e16\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n# OpenClaw: Setting Up Your First Personal AI Agent. People are building personal AI agents that text them back, order their groceries, and write code while they sleep—all with an open-source tool called OpenClaw. And **Claire Vo**, founder of ChatPRD, an AI platform for project managers, and host of the *How I AI* podcast, broke down the architectural principles that make these agents feel alive—and how her agent, Polly, helped her out on a diaper run. OpenClaw is a server that runs on your computer and acts as the brain of a personal AI agent. 2. **Self-installing tools.** The agent can use tools (browse the web, read files, run code), and discover and install new ones on its own. With Felix on Telegram, he can send a message like, “Update the FelixCraft AI website to say ‘Hi, Every,’” and Felix finds the right code repository, makes the change, pushes it to the live site, and reports back.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"2ef43d0b756c7e16\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.99948066\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"70599e2d04e455d1\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nCannot spawn sub-agents : r/openclaw\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"70599e2d04e455d1\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://www.reddit.com/r/openclaw/comments/1rjzeld/cannot_spawn_subagents/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"187fa7e6f104a367\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n# Cannot spawn sub-agents. “However, to address your request to create them all as persistent:. As we've discussed previously, I am currently unable to create persistent sub-agents. The Telegram channel plugin has a limitation where mode=\\\"session\\\" (which enables persistence) requires thread=true, and this capability is not supported by the plugin in its current configuration. Therefore, I cannot create them persistently as requested. I can only spawn them for one-off tasks (mode=\\\"run\\\") or as ACP sessions if an agentId is provided or acp.defaultAgent is configured. Since I cannot create them persistently, I cannot list their names as persistent agents. • Proceed with developing these components myself using web\\\\_search for research and my own coding capabilities for logic outlines, and then later initiate ACP sessions for the actual code generation if the agentId or configuration issues are resolved. • If you have an agentId available for ACP tasks, I could try spawning them that way, but they might not be persistent.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"187fa7e6f104a367\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.9992505\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"56a78279434771c8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Bug]: agent:main:main session responds to Telegram DMs ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"56a78279434771c8\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/40005\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bdfa413c93c88346\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nBoth agent:main:main and agent:main:telegram:direct respond to every Telegram DM. User receives two replies per message. OpenClaw version.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"bdfa413c93c88346\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.9987356\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"\"Need Help — Telegram agent persist on session/chat\" openclaw discussion","provider":"tavily","count":5,"tookMs":2432,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"tavily","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"00edd6c1b0512390\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nSession Management - OpenClaw\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"00edd6c1b0512390\">>>","url":"https://docs.openclaw.ai/concepts/session","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2261fa38c16bc927\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n##### Fundamentals. ##### Sessions and memory. ##### Multi-agent. ##### Messages and delivery. # Session Management. # ​ Session Management. ## ​ How messages are routed. | Direct messages | Shared session by default |. | Group chats | Isolated per group |. | Rooms/channels | Isolated per room |. | Cron jobs | Fresh session per run |. ## ​ DM isolation. dmScope: \"per-channel-peer\", // isolate by channel + sender. ## ​ Session lifecycle. ## ​ Where state lives. `~/.openclaw/agents/<agentId>/sessions/sessions.json`. `~/.openclaw/agents/<agentId>/sessions/<sessionId>.jsonl`. ## ​ Session maintenance. `openclaw sessions cleanup --dry-run`. ## ​ Inspecting sessions. ## ​ Further reading.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"2261fa38c16bc927\">>>","score":0.9997749},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6b95f3d1d5e96145\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nTelegram main session can wedge after long-running ...\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"6b95f3d1d5e96145\">>>","url":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/51014","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"b49e5888cd395f42\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nWhat happened. An OpenClaw insta