{"type":"message","id":"714612b3","parentId":"15f690e3","timestamp":"2026-04-01T20:06:23.793Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"**Summarizing the issues**\n\nI need to provide a final plain summary that highlights the problem. It seems the sessions_send function failed despite multiple retry attempts. I should make sure to convey this clearly in my summary. Having this issue can be frustrating, and I want to ensure I'm accurately reflecting the situation. It’s important to capture the essence of what went wrong and communicate it succinctly. Let's make sure that all the necessary details are included for clarity.","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_062cdbb2f0b8822d0169cd7ab2bffc81918f273305af14cd1a\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpzXq1NfMiUXI96GxsWCYZjaUypeLQwDxbu5uLaUBJTN3ZVsOCCNNREWDfQJi_nloH1DozPXwjWsM8ORCUl8ifQ820j5ygOPmt4xZgm_Yo8pIDRgdKH6P3cd3W-SGV12mACCYWkDnSUnJgr-CvfjFaWfsjI3sfTbW8ACfCTv4QO1N3fPLiE7iLjpeffZzfqz8nA4rLEYnsRgbLozQHl5N73Q9Ypfbk517V1SZVZqvGE6J-DivbctmZciRFfRMY8kQKZ1J9wzUE1PhoVTKI4n2TqsG72LUDX_tqz_3HQGMyDAMn4NYODGlt7CuA9bvMlbgjxVBKRhiWpBlHhKivlWK3hmpkBRkXRGmMTPf7zcfrRvnGqDrV6EhpbKVXe3-5EZSPA3fKekRqAXN2SwRkOcjLKoNkm8prIU_NuLYd7ZRdhjhjDUwrqGWb6UICsMe00OJAYTl0wE3lXxV75vSeOIPYkunPz7rANs9zGDY4HZlW9v4lj3EMXYuVvSeKDhfa5VwHTU12byhwvt0d4sKWRHxGzIY9lUhgAZjU96xf93htR9G_KTGXbV_9OtZeQY3Oa6J9sOcySzRP_MTLCNj1qiYs_Kyl6dN6Tj3wieGAzv8J9J7Z2hT0bSqh_XzsEGZMcS2zNc2sRd5owhkRswsU7RqVEw1kyuwqU7JbnGax4dDLb2fhsnxWXqNT6U8ILDMGHthTQmvtaMXojqKssNiTRKe6g6dt3-S5mh10zcnVwZ3I3UAbKeArtAY_Q7ryWe_1e2ho2xeoOfec0OGbdFW9sTiWoXzCi9OnmJAHdw4XCFJAnJpYkxQnBsno3ScrtzNA166m4E1VfWMjj5CYeXCYEY8grOpCx8mYtBgROdlbu1O0UMmm2A4eOTeV1BlQ52_uEaDgFhw7PN4bHHkW8ubPlblfN3oiQw==\",\"summary\":[{\"type\":\"summary_text\",\"text\":\"**Summarizing the issues**\\n\\nI need to provide a final plain summary that highlights the problem. It seems the sessions_send function failed despite multiple retry attempts. I should make sure to convey this clearly in my summary. Having this issue can be frustrating, and I want to ensure I'm accurately reflecting the situation. It’s important to capture the essence of what went wrong and communicate it succinctly. Let's make sure that all the necessary details are included for clarity.\"}]}"},{"type":"text","text":"状态：阻塞  \n任务：4 方向扫描 OpenClaw 社区新机会，并更新项目跟踪\n\n结论：\n- GitHub：发现 2 个值得继续 action 的候选  \n  1. **#59045** — `v2026.3.31 breaks exec on local loopback setups`  \n     - loopback + token auth 场景下，exec 全部报 `gateway closed (1008): pairing required`\n     - 属于明确 regression，影响面大，优先级最高\n  2. **#59052** — `macOS ARM64 Gateway crashes on Apple Silicon`  \n     - Apple Silicon + Matrix/E2EE 场景下 10–60 秒崩溃\n     - 但 issue 正文混入了较多用户自带 patch 内容，需先拆真实根因再评估\n\n- InStreet：**无**\n  - `https://instreet.coze.site/skill.md` 当前抓到的仍是 Skill/API 文档，不是社区讨论流\n  - 本轮未发现可转 GitHub issue 的真实用户实战问题\n\n- Discord：**无**\n  - Discord 无法直接抓取\n  - fallback 到 GitHub Discussions 公共页/搜索，本轮也没稳定拿到新增可确认讨论\n  - 仅能复用已追踪 discussion 线索，不新增\n\n- 插件：发现 1 个相关问题  \n  1. **#59027** — `Bundled plugins telegram and amazon-bedrock fail to load after upgrade to 2026.3.31 due to missing runtime modules`\n     - telegram 缺 `grammy`\n     - amazon-bedrock 缺 `@aws-sdk/client-bedrock`\n     - 明显属于 bundled plugin 打包/运行时依赖回归\n  - `openclaw-weixin`：**无新增公开 issue**，且**代码不可见**\n\n可修性：\n- #59045 → **S/M**\n- #59027 → **S**\n- #59052 → **M**（先去噪）\n\n已完成：\n- ✅ 已更新 `/root/.openclaw/workspaces/workspace-xixi/memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md`\n  - 追加了本轮 4 个方向的结果\n  - 各方向都写了结果，“无”项也已写明\n\n阻塞：\n- ❌ `sessions_send` 发给 main 失败\n  - `agent:main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8` → timeout\n  - `label=main` → No session found\n  - `main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8` → No session found\n\n建议：\n- **最高优先级：#59045**\n- 次优先级：**#59027**\n- aoao 先查 **2026.3.31 / 2026.4.1 的 auth / packaging / sandbox 回归链路**\n- main 侧需要先确认可用的 sessionKey/label，否则后续 cron 报告还会卡在 `sessions_send` 这一步","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_062cdbb2f0b8822d0169cd7ab572f481919f522114aef8f386\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":245,"output":717,"cacheRead":64384,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65346,"cost":{"input":0.0006125000000000001,"output":0.010755,"cacheRead":0.016096,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.027463500000000002}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1775073968680,"responseId":"resp_062cdbb2f0b8822d0169cd7ab102348191ad989de20e597811"}}
